---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const base = `${import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '')}/`;
---

<Layout
  title="Online Courses and Learning Pathways"
  description="Build skills through short online modules in Maths, Python Coding, Problem Solving and AI, with structured learning pathways and tutor guidance."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <p class="eyebrow">Online courses with tutor guidance</p>
      <h1>Build skills through short, focused modules</h1>
      <p>Learn one topic at a time, build confidence and progress towards a larger learning pathway in Maths, Coding, Problem Solving or AI.</p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="button primary" href={`${base}modules`}>Explore Modules</a>
        <a class="button secondary" href={`${base}learning-pathways`}>View Learning Pathways</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="subjects" class="section">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">Subject areas</p>
      <h2>Explore our subject areas</h2>
      <p>Choose a subject and start with a focused module. Some courses are available now, while more are being prepared.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="subject-grid">
      <a class="subject-card" href={`${base}subjects/mathematics`} aria-label="Explore Maths course">
        <span class="subject-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M18 5H7l6 7-6 7h11"></path></svg>
        </span>
        <h3>Maths</h3>
        <p>Build confidence through clear explanations, worked examples and regular practice.</p>
        <span class="subject-action">Explore course</span>
      </a>

      <a class="subject-card" href={`${base}subjects/computing-ai`} aria-label="Explore Computing and AI courses">
        <span class="subject-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="m8 8-4 4 4 4M16 8l4 4-4 4M14 5l-4 14"></path></svg>
        </span>
        <h3>Computing &amp; AI</h3>
        <p>Learn programming, computational thinking, artificial intelligence and responsible digital skills.</p>
        <span class="subject-action">Explore subjects</span>
      </a>

      <article class="subject-card subject-card--unavailable">
        <span class="subject-status">Coming soon</span>
        <span class="subject-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="1.5"></circle>
            <ellipse cx="12" cy="12" rx="9" ry="3.5"></ellipse>
            <ellipse cx="12" cy="12" rx="9" ry="3.5" transform="rotate(60 12 12)"></ellipse>
            <ellipse cx="12" cy="12" rx="9" ry="3.5" transform="rotate(120 12 12)"></ellipse>
          </svg>
        </span>
        <h3>Science</h3>
        <p>Explore Biology, Chemistry and Physics through clear explanations and practical study.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="subject-card subject-card--unavailable">
        <span class="subject-status">Coming soon</span>
        <span class="subject-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 5.5c3.5-1 6-.3 8 1.7v12c-2-2-4.5-2.7-8-1.7zM20 5.5c-3.5-1-6-.3-8 1.7v12c2-2 4.5-2.7 8-1.7z"></path></svg>
        </span>
        <h3>English</h3>
        <p>Develop reading, writing and communication skills.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="subject-card subject-card--unavailable">
        <span class="subject-status">Coming soon</span>
        <span class="subject-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="m15 9-2 4-4 2 2-4z"></path></svg>
        </span>
        <h3>Religion</h3>
        <p>Explore beliefs, traditions and how religion shapes people and communities.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="subject-card subject-card--unavailable">
        <span class="subject-status">Coming soon</span>
        <span class="subject-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 5h11v8H9l-4 3v-3H4zM11 13v5h5l3 2v-2h1v-8h-5"></path></svg>
        </span>
        <h3>Languages</h3>
        <p>Build communication skills and explore how languages connect people and cultures.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">Choose where to begin</p>
      <h2>A simpler way to explore TableTopLearning</h2>
      <p>Start with one topic or see how modules connect into a larger learning goal.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="overview-grid">
      <article class="overview-card">
        <span class="step-number" aria-hidden="true">1</span>
        <h3>Short modules</h3>
        <p>Focus on one skill at a time in Maths, Python, Problem Solving or AI.</p>
        <a class="button primary" href={`${base}modules`}>Explore Modules</a>
      </article>

      <article class="overview-card">
        <span class="step-number" aria-hidden="true">2</span>
        <h3>Learning pathways</h3>
        <p>See how related modules build towards a broader subject or preparation goal.</p>
        <a class="button secondary" href={`${base}learning-pathways`}>View Pathways</a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="how-it-works" class="section">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">How it works</p>
      <h2>Learn in manageable stages</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="step-list">
      <article class="step-card">
        <span class="step-number" aria-hidden="true">1</span>
        <h3>Choose a module</h3>
        <p>Start with a focused topic that matches your current goal.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="step-card">
        <span class="step-number" aria-hidden="true">2</span>
        <h3>Build your pathway</h3>
        <p>Complete related modules in a clear and manageable order.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="step-card">
        <span class="step-number" aria-hidden="true">3</span>
        <h3>Prepare for your next goal</h3>
        <p>Build skills towards a wider subject or qualification-preparation goal.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section homepage-support">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Tutor support</p>
      <h2>Choose the guidance that fits</h2>
      <p>Compare independent learning with options that include more regular tutor guidance.</p>
    </div>
    <a class="button secondary" href={`${base}support`}>View Support Options</a>
  </section>
</Layout>
